		"description": "<p>There are few Heralds charged with such terrible goals as the warbringer. Given a divine purpose to bring devastation and destruction upon their enemies, these heralds rally others to their banners, turn toward their foes, and lay waste to their armies with righteous fury.</p><p>It is from the warbringers that many revokers are born. Not all have the stomach to champion such widespread violence and pain. Yet those who do remain powerful, terrible, reminders of the power of faith.</p><p><strong>Table: Warbringer</strong></p><table style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 6.89619%;\"><col style=\"width: 93.1038%;\"></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>3rd</td><td><p>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.GV8hR0KLWgegLtqO]{Tenets of the Warbringer} @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.AU5fqW3x6Dypnwnn]{Archetype School} @UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.0kv5UHY0Tc47WE48]{Channel Divinity}</p></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>7th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.rd87JfAo3xffinjn]{Inspirational Figure}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>15th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.5BEXCr41Uy6HqEkw]{Loose the Dogs of War}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>20th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e-martial-artistry.class-features.Item.unc6LI2M7Pg2dUE5]{Champion of War}</td></tr></tbody></table><p> </p>",
